        "body": "Nine charts follow.\n\n```mermaid\npie title Chart 1\n  \"Done\" : 1\n  \"Open\" : 10\n```\n\n```mermaid\npie title Chart 2\n  \"Done\" : 2\n  \"Open\" : 9\n```\n\n```mermaid\npie title Chart 3\n  \"Done\" : 3\n  \"Open\" : 8\n```\n\n```mermaid\npie title Chart 4\n  \"Done\" : 4\n  \"Open\" : 7\n```\n\n```mermaid\npie title Chart 5\n  \"Done\" : 5\n  \"Open\" : 6\n```\n\n```mermaid\npie title Chart 6\n  \"Done\" : 6\n  \"Open\" : 5\n```\n\n```mermaid\npie title Chart 7\n  \"Done\" : 7\n  \"Open\" : 4\n```\n\n```mermaid\npie title Chart 8\n  \"Done\" : 8\n  \"Open\" : 3\n```\n\n```mermaid\npie title Chart 9\n  \"Done\" : 9\n  \"Open\" : 2\n```\n\nText after the ninth chart."
